WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.660
Some four-species defects have different first

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:04.320
day and later day rules.

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:07.220
Review the context instead of repeating yesterday's

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:08.240
judgment automatically.

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:11.220
Correct practice includes thoughtful reassessment.
